'' THE BUILD ORDER IS DEPENDENCIES FIRST, and a module reached twice is one node. http and
'' esc both import core, and http imports esc too -- once by package path and once by a
'' relative one, which name the same chain. -i makes libs/ a package search root, so the
'' first segment 'acme' names libs/acme (ADR 0017; RFC-0005 §2, RFC-0007 §3).
